# Failure contract: the download fails and the file is still empty -> honest failure panel,
# the 0-byte stub is left intact, and the STOCK LAUNCHER IS NEVER RUN on an empty file.
desc fetch: download fails -> honest error, stub intact, NO launch of a 0-byte file
invoke wrap
config paired
wifi up
sdfile Roms/GBA/Zelda.gba
engine 4|DLFAIL getrom
expect_exit 0
expect_trace ENGINE --download
expect_trace PANEL mode=auto title='Download failed'
expect_file_empty Roms/GBA/Zelda.gba
expect_trace_absent STOCK
expect_log fetch-on-launch FAILED
